9.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending Section 2.2.8, Assigned Zoning, of the
Cheyenne Unified Development Code to conform with the comprehensive revision of
Laramie County Zoning Regulations.

ACTION:

10.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending Section 8.60.050, Weeds as a Nuisance, of
the Municipal Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, to revise and clarify provisions
and specify conditions under which vegetation does not constitute a nuisance.

ACTION:

11.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of
Cheyenne, changing the zoning classification from P - Public and MUB Mixed-Use
Business Emphasis to CBD Central Business District for land located between O’Neil
Avenue and Carey Avenue, north of West 19th Street and south of West 22nd Street.

ACTION:
